webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8922958faa51e4f47a40085ab0e7542c, https://si.imgix.net/4d328973/uploads/origins/a6fccab3-11ec-444d-bea1-6227ac0b5f2d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d8e4bec87284bbff5c6bb3cc00961c9e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4d328973/uploads/origins/a6fccab3-11ec-444d-bea1-6227ac0b5f2d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c4f46ad43607d8ad730996e84603b381 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ミシ・ポーター・ブリッジズをお願いします！ \nポッドの中に本体、体は男性体で、16:9のサムネ使用をイメージした物にして下さるととても嬉しいです！ 表情、ポーズなどは鉄蛙さんのセンスにおまかせしたく思います！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@metalfrog_24gw/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/43e60090/uploads/origins/cd154b1e-0c81-42c3-a674-527317bb368a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=19a62ba7e4b1302e9e840df068ee76c2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/43e60090/uploads/origins/cd154b1e-0c81-42c3-a674-527317bb368a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=19a62ba7e4b1302e9e840df068ee76c2, https://si.imgix.net/43e60090/uploads/origins/cd154b1e-0c81-42c3-a674-527317bb368a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7b68474e6e0613839444bc25961a8e36 2x, https://si.imgix.net/43e60090/uploads/origins/cd154b1e-0c81-42c3-a674-527317bb368a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b942c982ed37c0c0267e4832b96b4477 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "撮影風景の雰囲気で\n\n・右顔 照れ顔、ビキニパレオ風 主体白\nパレオはピンク色柄付き。髪色赤\n\n・左顔 楽しそうに、水着ワンショルダーフリル付ビキニ水色、イルカマーク付\n髪色茶色\n\n・キャラは前回同様アイコンで", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@metalfrog_24gw/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/529f667c/uploads/origins/b7fd3cc2-8e37-4dd8-ac0d-096307db6060?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3db5d6510a274b30e04975b0c5bee5fb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/529f667c/uploads/origins/b7fd3cc2-8e37-4dd8-ac0d-096307db6060?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3db5d6510a274b30e04975b0c5bee5fb, https://si.imgix.net/529f667c/uploads/origins/b7fd3cc2-8e37-4dd8-ac0d-096307db6060?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c48a2328c0b7df6df078559e7d1ca8f8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/529f667c/uploads/origins/b7fd3cc2-8e37-4dd8-ac0d-096307db6060?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=784fd529275463bc691f8beaa045b50d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hey im resending the request with fixed link! \n\nHello! I'm very interested in your art style I want to get my VTuber art, I added the poses linked here as well as the reference sheet in this folder. \n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/12F5d6Ns2AZtPXZoR3WdRjxZ6z7yW1xRX?usp=sharing\n\n For the pose (provided at the link), I found her a weapon surrounded by electric current (it's her power) I would like to have (provided in a folder). And please don't wear a jacket. Add her tattoo too.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@metalfrog_24gw/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/82ad4ef8/uploads/origins/abe856fb-9f0c-4f1d-bdbd-125ff2ba259e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aa2b8edc96312a703eecf669239a4ee0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/82ad4ef8/uploads/origins/abe856fb-9f0c-4f1d-bdbd-125ff2ba259e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aa2b8edc96312a703eecf669239a4ee0, https://si.imgix.net/82ad4ef8/uploads/origins/abe856fb-9f0c-4f1d-bdbd-125ff2ba259e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=83e71fa3dc33763f03cd7a93b3884327 2x, https://si.imgix.net/82ad4ef8/uploads/origins/abe856fb-9f0c-4f1d-bdbd-125ff2ba259e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f1dbfdb83608f38d1379d31ab6fa71af 3x", "